{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ellipseIn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rect","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Rect3D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial6Rect3DV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The rectangle that bounds the ellipse.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"rect"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is a convenience function that creates a path of an ellipse.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Using this convenience function is more efficient than creating a path and adding an ellipse to it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ellipse is approximated by a sequence of Bézier curves.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Its center is the midpoint of the rectangle defined by the rect parameter.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If the rectangle is square, then the ellipse is circular with a radius equal to one-half the width (or height) of the rectangle.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If the rect parameter specifies a rectangular shape, then the major and minor axes of the ellipse are defined by the width and height of the rectangle.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ellipse forms a complete subpath of the path—that is, the ellipse drawing starts with a move-to operation and ends with a close-subpath operation, with all moves oriented in the clockwise direction.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If you supply an affine transform, then the constructed Bézier curves that define the ellipse are transformed before they are added to the path.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path\/init(ellipseIn:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a path as an ellipse within the given rectangle."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/path\/init(ellipsein:)"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4PathV9ellipseInAC0A7Spatial6Rect3DV_tcfc","roleHeading":"Initializer","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ellipseIn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Rect3D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial6Rect3DV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"init(ellipseIn:)","symbolKind":"init"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Path":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Path","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Path","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/path","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Path","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The outline of a 2D shape."}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Path/init(ellipseIn:)":{"title":"init(ellipseIn:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/path\/init(ellipsein:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path\/init(ellipseIn:)","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ellipseIn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial6Rect3DV","text":"Rect3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a path as an ellipse within the given rectangle."}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"title":"OpenSwiftUI","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[]}}}